-        "A signature trait — a metaphor family, a verbal tic, a physical mannerism — is a distribution to sample at the rhythm the character would actually produce: a few times a scene, salient by scarcity.",
-        "SINGLE-FEATURE OVER-FOCUS (named failure): the same identifying feature deployed every paragraph — every perception routed through one frame — until the character becomes the tic.",
