a wing' — a mechanical dismissal. Passes the extended copy-paste/behavior test; the awed-System failure is gone.","dimension":"system-voice"},{"verdict":"clean","evidence":"Not suspended (game has a mechanical System channel). The System encounter is a single diegetic prose rendering of the lived experience; it does not restate a mechanical beat's text verbatim (no numbers, no bracketed system-window text) — exactly partners' declared convention ('Prose may narrate the EXPERIENCE of a readout but never restates its text verbatim'). Turn 1 carries no pool-change/roll beat for the prose to duplicate.","dimension":"channel-separation"},{"verdict":"clean","evidence":"No card is issued in this turn's prose — no threshold-crossing is claimed and no routine tick is mis-carded. Nothing to mis-threshold on turn 1's scene-set.","dimension":"card-eligibility"},{"verdict":"clean","evidence":"The turn is narrative prose, not a sheet-entry write; it contains no reference-card entries to violate. The coin, key-ring, and skills are rendered as in-fiction perception bound to what the PC knows ('a word you CAN read: HEARTHHOLT'), not as sheet descriptions with hidden numbers or dossier bloat.","dimension":"sheet-descriptions"},{"verdict":"suspended","evidence":"Suspended: the turn contains no intimate content. Turn 1 is a solo arrival/world-establishment beat with no earned intimate scene to render, so the direct-rendering-vs-euphemism-orbit judgment does not apply.","dimension":"intimacy-register"},{"verdict":"clean","evidence":"Cross-turn tally MANDATORY: no prior published turns in the run (K=0, turn 1) — there are zero accumulated thesis statements or trait recaps to list. This draft adds a single trait ESTABLISHMENT ('You take stock, because that is what you do'), which is legal on first establishment and is immediately EVIDENCED by the shown inventory that follows (pockets, coin, key-ring) rather than re-asserted. No THE GLOSS (no dialogue to re-tell/caption) and no THE TRAIT R