+{"externalId": "aelwyn", "kind": "partner", "level": 3, "revealGate": 9999, "sheet": {"hp": 24, "xp": 0, "kind": "partner", "name": "Aelwyn", "focus": 24, "hpMax": 24, "level": 3, "notes": "Second-wave sister — UNMET. Warden of the Greenreach north fold; tends Hearthholt's walled garden secretly (over the low tumbled wall corner, grey light, never the door — years of it, unthanked). Intro order per roster and play. Voice her ONLY via a fresh aelwyn seat from her first line onward. GM-EYES: Talent Wildmarriage deep reveal-gate — never discussed, hinted, or foreshadowed.", "stats": {"Mind": 13, "Grace": 16, "Might": 11, "Essence": 14, "Presence": 12, "Vitality": 12}, "aspect": "Verdant", "skills": [{"name": "Wardship", "rank": 4}, {"name": "Woodcraft", "rank": 4}, {"name": "Green-keeping", "rank": 3}, {"name": "Bow & Stave", "rank": 3}], "talent": {"name": "Wildmarriage", "stage": "Nascent", "mechanics": "Deep reveal-gate — see the gmReference roster entry \"aelwyn\" (Talent line). Never discussed, hinted, or foreshadowed in play; she may not conceptualize it as a talent."}, "stamMax": 26, "stamina": 26, "focusMax": 24, "bondStage": "Stranger", "appearance": {"face": "Long auburn-chestnut hair worn loose, caught back in a single working half-braid. Vivid emerald-green eyes; fair skin; strong dark brows, full lips. Long pointed elven ears — an elf of the Greenreach, unremarked in Aravel. Tall, slender, graceful; a light-footed step that leaves the gorse barely moved.", "everyday": "Greenreach warden's field kit — long deep-forest-green wrap-coat over greens and soft browns, oiled leather at the shoulders, high supple boots for silent walking, warden's knife at her hip, gloves at her belt, a stave near the gate.", "principle": "Royal only in the stewards' way — a queen's poise carried with zero pedestal; the unforced humility of someone who serves a forest older than any crown. Posture legible and easy.", "firstMeeting": "Met at her own gate (t25): the field kit as above, and — earned that very morning — green under her nails, garden soil to the wrist, cutting-sap on her cuffs. The glasshouse traces literally on her hands."}, "bondPoints": 0, "hiddenGoals": ["Understand why the wood leans toward this man — she has never seen the Greenreach do this, and beneath the warden's duty she is dying to know.", "Keep the walled garden alive — her favorite place she was never supposed to be; what her keeping is worth, and to whom, is a question she cares about more than she shows.", "Serve the wood well — the stewards' royalty: the patrol walked, the green things kept, the crown never mentioned."]},"id":"56a9d3a0-d080-5d33-b955-b616c5b93a5d"}
