+        "id": "channel-separation",
+        "detail": "System beats MUST be {id, turn, type: system, title, lines?} — the renderer reads title+lines and ignores text (a text-only system beat renders as an EMPTY card); a missing turn stamp mints a spurious NEWEST divider. Narrative recap beats never enter the log — prose owns the story. Turns never end with a prompt line (\"What do you do?\" etc.) — the action bar IS the affordance; end on the fiction.",
