+        "detail": "System windows fire only for TRUE state events: registry events, LEVEL-UPS (never raw XP gains — Alan's call 2026-07-03; XP totals live on the sheet only), skill rank-ups, bond stage changes. No progress-tick notices, no reason tags. Crunch is done, not always shown.",
